      "common:shortName": [],
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "A paper bag is a bag made of paper, usually kraft paper. They can be made either with virgin or recycled fibres. Paper bags are commonly used as shopping carrier bags and for packaging of some consumer goods. They are a type of packaging deemed less harmful than plastic bags. They are reusable, biodegradable and recyclable. Paper bags come in different shapes and sizes, with two basic types: open mouth and valve.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "纸袋是由纸制成的袋子，通常是牛皮纸。它们可以由原生纤维或回收纤维制成。纸袋通常用作购物手提袋和包装一些消费品。它们被认为是比塑料袋更不有害的包装类型。它们是可重复使用的，可生物降解的和可回收的。纸袋有不同的形状和大小，有两种基本类型：开口和阀门。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
